"""
SEC Form 13F-HR scanner - tracks quarterly position changes for whale funds.

For each whale CIK:
  1. Check EDGAR submissions API for latest 13F-HR
  2. If accession number changed from last seen, fetch information table XML
  3. Parse all positions (cusip, ticker via lookup, value, shares, putcall)
  4. Diff against prior quarter snapshot
  5. Post NEW positions, ADDS, CUTS, EXITS to Discord

State persisted in openclaw/state/sec_scanner/13f/<CIK>.json
"""
